      "message": "Wrapping `bitwriter_buffer.h` in `#pragma GCC visibility push(hidden)` marks `aom_wb_write_unsigned_literal` as `STV_HIDDEN`, which breaks ELF `-DBUILD_SHARED_LIBS\u003d1` builds when linking `svc_encoder_rtc` (`examples/svc_encoder_rtc.cc:1433` calls `aom_wb_write_unsigned_literal` and previously resolved it via `libaom_av1_rc.so`). Either inline `aom_wb_write_unsigned_literal` in this header alongside `aom_wb_write_literal`, or drop the `visibility push(hidden)` pragma here (`libaom.so` already hides `aom_wb_*` via its version script).",
